openapi-python-client template-derived code
==========================================

lib/attune_client/ is generated from the Attune OpenAPI specification using
openapi-python-client, as documented in .scripts/generate_client.sh.
It includes code from the generator's templates. In particular,
lib/attune_client/types.py matches the upstream types.py.jinja template.

Upstream: https://github.com/openapi-generators/openapi-python-client
Template: https://github.com/openapi-generators/openapi-python-client/blob/main/openapi_python_client/templates/types.py.jinja
License source: https://github.com/openapi-generators/openapi-python-client/blob/main/LICENSE

